        truths: ("{DL} had a prior case in this court.", "{V} gave {DL} a written list of bills to pay, and none was a phone company."),
        defendant: [.direct("Did you use your client's card?", "\"I used it for {V.his} errands, as {V.he} asked, and some for my own needs. I know that was wrong.\""), .direct("What did {V.he} ask you to buy?", "\"Groceries and {V.his} phone bill. {V.He} asked me to use the card because {V.he} couldn't get out.\""), .direct("What about the electronics?", "\"I bought a tablet for {V.him}, but I also bought items for myself. I told myself I'd pay it back.\""), .direct("Did you pay your own phone bill?", "\"Yes, with {V.his} card. I was behind, and I took advantage.\""), .direct("What did you do when the agency called?", "\"I admitted it when they asked, and I gave them my receipts and my statements.\""), .direct("What would you tell your client and {V.his} family?", "\"I'm so sorry for taking advantage of {V.his} trust. I'll repay every dollar.\""), .cross("You've been charged with taking from a client before, haven't you?", "\"Yes, and the judge made me promise that this would not happen again. I'm ashamed.\""), .cross("You used an elderly woman's card to pay your own phone bill?", "\"I did, and I know that's a serious wrong.\""), .cross("{V.He} trusted you with {V.his} card?", "\"{V.He} did trust me with the card, and I let {V.him} down badly.\""), .cross("You'll repay two thousand three hundred fifty dollars?", "\"Yes, on a schedule. I have already talked to the bank about taking a little out of each paycheck.\""), .cross("You'll stop working with elderly clients?", "\"Yes, I'll stop working with elderly clients, and I'll find a different job.\"")],
