        closings: ("The log shows {D}'s login at 2:07 a.m. and a bulk delete of the whole folder, and with {PRIOR} behind {D.him}, {DL} knew what that folder held.", "A cleanup that went too far is a mistake, not a sabotage. The State must prove {D} meant to destroy {V}'s work."),
