        defendant: [.direct("Did you leave your child in the car?", "\"Yes, I did. I thought I'd only be five minutes, and I was wrong. I'm so sorry.\""), .direct("Why did you leave your child?", "\"The child had fallen asleep, and I didn't want to wake {V.him}. I meant to run in and out.\""), .direct("Why were you inside so long?", "\"The lines were long, and then I couldn't find an item I needed. I lost track of the time.\""), .direct("Did you know it was that hot?", "\"I knew it was warm, but I didn't realize how hot a car gets so fast. I should have known.\""), .direct("What did you do when you saw the crowd around your car?", "\"I ran to my child and held {V.him}. I thanked the people who helped.\""), .direct("What would you tell the shopper and your child?", "\"Thank you for saving my child. I'll never leave {V.him} alone again, as long as I live.\""), .cross("You've been warned about leaving a child alone before, haven't you?", "\"Yes, and I made a promise to the court then that I haven't kept. I'm ashamed.\""), .cross("Twenty-five minutes in ninety-one degrees can kill a child, can't it?", "\"It can, and I think about that every night. I could have lost my child.\""), .cross("You could have taken the child into the store?", "\"I could have, and I should have taken {V.him} in. I didn't want to wake {V.him}.\""), .cross("You'll accept parenting classes?", "\"Yes, I'll take any class the court orders, and I'll finish it.\""), .cross("You'll never leave your child alone in a car again?", "\"Never again. I'll bring {V.him} with me every time, even if {V.he} is asleep.\"")],
